Use this format in script TODO lists:

- [ ] <type>[(<scope>)]: item as commit message (type-item)

Core Types

feat: Adds a new feature to the code.
fix: Fixes a bug in the code.
chore: Handles routine tasks or maintenance that do not change production code.

Supporting Types

docs: Changes only to documentation files like the README.
style: Changes to code formatting, white space, or missing semicolons that do not change how the code works.
refactor: Rewrites or restructures code without adding a feature or fixing a bug.
perf: Code changes that make the program run faster.
test: Adds new tests or fixes old ones.
build: Changes that affect the build system or external dependencies.
ci: Changes to continuous integration files and scripts.
revert: Rolls back a previous commit.

